    "description": "The insight sentence on a calm reading. \"Do not cross\", not \"stay below\": a top three of exactly 70.0 % is still ok, so \"below\" would be false at the boundary. The threshold is a placeholder rather than a literal so the sentence cannot drift away from PoolConcentration.topThreeWarningThreshold.",
